aipagam, George Town\n\n1. Employee Training: Trained a new employee on the working principles and circuit-level operation of two electronic circuits.\n2. College Workshop Preparation: Designed and prepared three electronic circuits for the upcoming college workshops.\n3. Quotation Preparation: Prepared a quotation for PCB reverse engineering, including the scope of work and estimated project cost.', E'admin', E'approved', E'gkbharath', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'2026-11-05T11:23:31.323Z', E'2026-11-06T04:10:05.551Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO NOTHING;
