-30T05:58:30.685Z"}, {"by": "hareeshv", "comment": "", "decision": "approve", "stageIndex": 1, "at": "2026-10-30T05:57:03.947Z"}, {"by": "sabir", "comment": "", "decision": "recommend", "stageIndex": 0, "at": "2026-10-30T03:33:37.234Z"}]}'::jsonb, E'Finalized the modular architecture strategy, separating the low-voltage control board from the high-voltage SSR power stages.\n\nDetermined the component specifications for the Power Supply Unit (Section A), including wide-input AC-DC modules and MOV surge protection.\n\nDesigned the Core Sensing network (Section B), specifying burden resistors for the CTs and Zener clamping for safe MCU voltage readings.\n\nUpdated the User Interface hardware to match the provided physical enclosure, finalizing the 7-segment displays, LED indicators, and selector switch logic.', E'admin', E'approved', E'gkbharath', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'2026-10-28T12:05:16.273Z', E'2026-10-30T05:59:43.408Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO NOTHING;
