f companies working in embedded systems, PCB design, IoT, and electronics engineering. The research will help in identifying companies and their areas of specialization.', E'admin', E'rejected', E'santhanakumarv', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'2026-10-26T11:59:55.873Z', E'2026-10-26T13:02:42.741Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO NOTHING;
